# Copy this file and pass -DBEXT_GIT_REMAP=/path/to/your-mirrors.txt.
# Uncomment entries to replace individual repositories with mirrors or upstreams.
# Every destination must supply the commit pinned by bext.
# Relative local destinations are relative to this file. Do not quote values.
# Full-line comments only; no variable expansion or includes.

